@startuml state_complaint_lifecycle
!theme plain
title Máquina de Estados Finitos del Ciclo de Vida de la Denuncia\nEstados y Transiciones del Esquema SQL + Backend Node.js

skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #1E3A8A
  ArrowColor #DC2626
}

state "GRACE_PERIOD\n(ventana de gracia\n180 s efectivos)" as GRACE_PERIOD #D9770633
state "PENDING_REVIEW\n(pendiente de\nrevisión)" as PENDING_REVIEW #D9770633
state "REJECTED\n(rechazada)" as REJECTED #DC262633
state "ASSIGNED\n(asignada a\nunidad municipal)" as ASSIGNED #EA580C33
state "IN_PROGRESS\n(en atención\ntécnica)" as IN_PROGRESS #EA580C33
state "SOLUTION_SUBMITTED\n(solución propuesta,\nen verificación)" as SOLUTION_SUBMITTED #EA580C33
state "RESOLVED\n(resuelta)" as RESOLVED #16A34A33
state "ELIMINADA\n(soft-delete\nvisible solo en BD)" as ELIMINATED #DC262655

[*] --> GRACE_PERIOD : POST /complaints\n(creación: remaining=180,\n running_since=now())

GRACE_PERIOD --> GRACE_PERIOD : PUT /edit-session/start\n(pausa reloj)\nPUT /complaints/:id\n(guarda + reanuda)\nPOST /edit-session/cancel\n(descarta + reanuda)
GRACE_PERIOD --> ELIMINATED : DELETE /complaints/:id\n(dentro de gracia)\n→ deleted_at=now(),\n  sin cooldown

GRACE_PERIOD --> PENDING_REVIEW : Expira 180 s efectivos\n(acceso lazy o barrido 30s)\n→ formalized_at=now(),\n  status='PENDING_REVIEW',\n  + citizen_submission_limits\n  (cooldown 60 min)

PENDING_REVIEW --> ASSIGNED : POST /approve\n{ municipalUnitId }\n→ moderation_reviews(APPROVED),\n  complaint_assignments,\n  status='ASSIGNED',\n  formalized_at ya seteado

PENDING_REVIEW --> REJECTED : POST /reject\n{ rejectionReason }\n→ moderation_reviews(REJECTED),\n  status='REJECTED'\n(motivo obligatorio:\nCHECK en BD)

ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS : POST /start-process\n(Enlace Técnico)\n→ history:\n'TECHNICAL_WORK_STARTED'

IN_PROGRESS --> SOLUTION_SUBMITTED : POST /submit-solution\n{ description }\n→ complaint_solutions(SUBMITTED),\n  status='SOLUTION_SUBMITTED'

SOLUTION_SUBMITTED --> RESOLVED : POST /solutions/:id/verify\n{ decision: 'APPROVE' }\n→ solution.status='APPROVED',\n  status='RESOLVED',\n  resolved_at=now()\n(asignación sigue activa:\ntrazabilidad)

SOLUTION_SUBMITTED --> IN_PROGRESS : POST /solutions/:id/verify\n{ decision: 'RETURN',\n  reviewComment }\n→ solution.status='RETURNED',\n  status='IN_PROGRESS'\n(el Moderador devuelve\ncon comentario obligatorio)

IN_PROGRESS --> SOLUTION_SUBMITTED : POST /submit-solution\n(reintento: nueva\ncomplaint_solutions row,\nla anterior queda RETURNED)

note bottom of GRACE_PERIOD
  Sub-estados del reloj:
  RUNNING: grace_running_since ≠ NULL
  PAUSED_FOR_EDIT: grace_running_since IS NULL
  (sesión abierta en complaint_grace_sessions)
  
  Invariante: remaining + elapsed ≤ 180
  (CHECK: grace_remaining_seconds
  BETWEEN 0 AND 180)
end note

note bottom of ELIMINATED
  La denuncia borrada conserva:
  - deleted_at (timestamp)
  - deletion_reason (VARCHAR 100)
  - status queda en el último valor
  - reloj congelado (running_since=NULL)
  
  Invisible para:
  - Bandeja del Moderador (WHERE deleted_at IS NULL)
  - "Mis Denuncias" (WHERE deleted_at IS NULL)
  - Mapa administrativo
  - Búsqueda de duplicados
end note

note right of RESOLVED
  Estados terminales:
  - RESOLVED: flujo exitoso
  - REJECTED: el Moderador
    la rechazó con motivo
  - ELIMINATED: el ciudadano
    la borró en gracia
  
  Ninguna transición sale
  de un estado terminal
  (salvo reingreso por
  nueva denuncia).
end note

@enduml
